<title>HONG KONG: Pearl Oriental sells office property.</title>
<headline>Pearl Oriental sells office property.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pearl Oriental Holdings Ltd said in a statement on Thursday it had signed a contract to sell a 25,830-square-feet office property for HK$330 million.</p>
<p>The disposal of the property, in Shun Tak Centre in Sheung Wan district on Hong Kong island, would bring an unaudited gross profit of about HK$110 million before the inclusion of the rental income earned and other expenses.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
